s="container"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><h2 class="font-inter mb-8 text-center text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px]"><span class="mb-2 block sm:mb-3 md:mb-4 lg:mb-6">Precise Translation, Thoughtful Dubbing</span>VideoLingo Makes Videos More Personal</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature1.png" alt="Cultural Localization" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Cultural Localization</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Deliver translations with the authentic expressions and cultural nuances.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature2.png" alt="Domain Expertise" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Domain Expertise</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Accurately translate field-specific terminology to maintain professional.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature3.png" alt="Enhanced Readability" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Enhanced Readability</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Single-line subtitles with precise timing and proper segmentation.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature4.png" alt="Natural Voice Synthesis" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Natural Voice Synthesis</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Intelligent dubbing with the original&#x27;s emotional tone and speaking style.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature5.png" alt="Streamlined Processing" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Streamlined Processing</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Fast and efficient pipeline for content transformation.
Just a few clicks to get started!</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start p-4 text-left transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out hover:scale-105 hover:transform sm:p-6"><div class="mb-4 flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#F3EEE2] p-4 sm:p-6"><img src="/images/feature6.png" alt="Global Accessibility" class="h-auto w-[80%]"/></div><h3 class="font-inter mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-xl">Global Accessibility</h3><p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-700 sm:text-base">Support 8+ languages to facilitate global knowledge exchange.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full  bg-[#F8F6F2]  py-12"><div class="container"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-4 py-10 md:py-20"><h2 class="mb-4 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:mb-6 md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl">Knowledge Knows No Bounds 🌱</h2><div class="mb-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4 md:mb-12 md:flex-row md:space-x-8 md:space-y-0"><div class="flex items-center space-x-2"><svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gray-900 md:h-8 md:w-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>