icing plans based on video length and required services (such as translation, dubbing, etc.). For detailed pricing information, please check our pricing page or contact us for a custom quote.\"},{\"q\":\"Which languages are supported?\",\"a\":\"VideoLingo supports translation and dubbing for many major languages, including English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, and more. For a complete list of supported languages, please visit our language support page.\"},{\"q\":\"How do you ensure translation accuracy?\",\"a\":\"We employ a multi-step verification process, combining AI technology with human review to ensure translation accuracy. For technical terms or industry-specific content, we also use relevant terminology databases for verification.\"}]},\"comments\":{\"title\":\"People ❤️ VideoLingo\",\"items\":[{\"content\":\"Amazing bilingual subtitles quality, perfectly capturing technical details in my programming tutorials\",\"author\":\"David Miller\",\"title\":\"Full Stack Development Instructor\"},{\"content\":\"Professional and authentic translations that finally express technical content naturally\",\"author\":\"Emily Johnson\",\"title\":\"Technical Content Creator\"},{\"content\":\"Precise subtitle translations with excellent technical terminology. Feels like native Chinese content\",\"author\":\"Michael Lee\",\"title\":\"Tech Blogger\"},{\"content\":\"Perfect word choice and tone in bilingual subtitles, making my design tutorials globally accessible\",\"author\":\"Jessica Chen\",\"title\":\"Designer\"},{\"content\":\"Accurately handles technical terms without the typical machine translation stiffness\",\"author\":\"Chris Evans\",\"title\":\"Technical Training Instructor\"},{\"content\":\"Professional subtitle layout and timing, with excellent technical translation accuracy\",\"author\":\"Sophia Zhang\",\"title\":\"Programming Community Founder\"}]},\"footer\":{\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"privacy_policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"terms_of_service\":\"Terms of Service\